{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game operates on the premise of <strong>moving two heavy craniums</strong> that <strong>can only jump</strong> and are <strong>linked by a rope</strong>. With this limitation, you must learn to move in all directions, climb <strong>a surreal set of obstacles</strong> (like in life?), and <strong>perhaps also learn something about yourself</strong>. You can also listen to the characters discuss and react to the problems they face in their particular situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/bdf6199a5a110e7b448a4423da7746a9.poster.avif?t=1763999635\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/bdf6199a5a110e7b448a4423da7746a9.webm?t=1763999635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/bdf6199a5a110e7b448a4423da7746a9.mp4?t=1763999635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only two buttons to move.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging physics-based gameplay</strong> (Newton would probably find it easy).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The great company of those two</strong> even though they don't get along too well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 - \u221e hours of gameplay depending on your skill level.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fierce effort of endurance and skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538140/extras/0bb4cb2e1a9ee8010a1498579cbe6e66.poster.avif?t=1763999635\" wid